{"id":2356,"date":"2024-09-19T12:36:12","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:36:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2356"},"modified":"2025-10-02T10:39:35","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T10:39:35","slug":"cardboard-boxes-for-bottles","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-for-bottles\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Boxes For Bottles"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Empty Cardboard Boxes for Bottles Made to Order<\/h2>\n<p>Looking for reliable, secure packaging for your bottles? We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em><strong>Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/em><\/a> provide <strong>custom cardboard boxes for bottles<\/strong> designed to protect and present your products professionally. Whether you&#8217;re packaging wine, cosmetics, sauces, or essential oils, we\u2019ve got the right solution for your business.<\/p>\n<p>We specialize in <strong>cardboard boxes for bottles wholesale<\/strong>, offering cost-effective packaging with quality material, high-end printing, and fast delivery. You can also get <strong>empty cardboard boxes for bottles<\/strong> tailored to your needs.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Reliable Bottles Packaging Boxes for Every Industry<\/h2>\n<h3>Built for Protection and Stability<\/h3>\n<p>Our <strong>bottles packaging boxes<\/strong> are made from strong materials like corrugated cardboard, Bux board, and eco Kraft. These materials help absorb impact and keep glass or plastic bottles secure during transport.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Reinforced walls prevent bending<\/li>\n<li>Options for single or multi-bottle compartments<\/li>\n<li>Die-cut inserts and partitions to reduce movement<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Custom Fit for Any Bottle Shape or Size<\/h3>\n<p>No matter the bottle shape, we offer custom sizes that match your product dimensions perfectly. Whether you need slim boxes for essential oils or <strong>large cardboard boxes for bottles<\/strong>, we deliver according to your specifications.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Single-bottle to 12-pack configurations<\/li>\n<li>Horizontal or vertical box layouts<\/li>\n<li>Neck stabilizers for glass bottles<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<table style=\"height: 358px;\" width=\"763\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Box Sizes<\/td>\n<td>All Custom Sizes &amp; Shapes Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing Options<\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Foil Stamping, Embossing, Raised Ink<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Choices<\/td>\n<td>Eco-Friendly Kraft, Corrugated E-flute, Bux Board, White SBS<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coating Finishes<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Insert Options<\/td>\n<td>Die-cut Partitions, Foam, Cardboard Dividers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style Variants<\/td>\n<td>Tuck End, Mailer, Sleeve, Two-Piece, Gable, Handle<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quantity Range<\/td>\n<td>100 \u2013 500,000 Units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Design Proof<\/td>\n<td>Flat View, 3D Mock-up, Physical Sample (On Request)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Turnaround Time<\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days Standard, Rush Orders Available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Support<\/td>\n<td>Free Design Assistance with Every Order<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"324\">Customization Options to Match Your Brand<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"451\">We provide multiple ways to personalize your folding cardboard boxes so they align with your product and customer experience.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"830\">If you&#8217;re searching for item-specific packaging solutions, we also recommend exploring our wide range of <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/packaging-for-specific-items\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"671\"><strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"591\">Packaging For Specific Items<\/strong><\/a> to match your industry needs. Whether you\u2019re packaging apparel, small electronics, or food items, you\u2019ll find structure types designed for different products.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"867\">Coating and Finish Choices<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"988\">To enhance your packaging appearance, we offer multiple finishing options that increase visibility and consumer appeal.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1119\">\n<li data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1035\">\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1035\">Gloss finish for a polished, vibrant look<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1080\">\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1080\">Matte finish for a clean, smooth texture<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1119\">\n<p data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1119\">Spot UV to highlight logos or text<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1158\">Branding and Design Features<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1282\">Your packaging should reflect your brand. That&#8217;s why we offer complete customization, from box style to printed messaging.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1428\">\n<li data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1328\">\n<p data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1328\">Add your logo, product info, or barcodes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1374\">\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1374\">Choose inside printing for added surprise<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1428\">\n<p data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1428\">Use foil stamping or raised ink for premium touch<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Choose Cardboard Boxes for Bottles Wholesale<\/h2>\n<h3>Cost Benefits of Bulk Orders<\/h3>\n<p>Choosing <strong>cardboard boxes for bottles wholesale<\/strong> helps reduce your overall packaging cost and ensures a steady supply for fulfillment.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lower unit cost<\/li>\n<li>Ready inventory when needed<\/li>\n<li>Consistent packaging across batches<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3>Suited for All Businesses<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re a startup or an established brand, our wholesale program supports businesses at every stage.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Beverage producers<\/li>\n<li>Cosmetic brands<\/li>\n<li>Subscription box companies<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Eco-Friendly Material Choices<\/h2>\n<h3>Sustainable Packaging Solutions<\/h3>\n<p>We offer recyclable and biodegradable materials to meet environmental expectations.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Brown Kraft for organic or eco-themed products<\/li>\n<li>White cardstock for a clean retail look<\/li>\n<li>Corrugated board for shipping protection<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>This also helps your brand stay compliant with sustainability goals.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Easy Ordering Process<\/h2>\n<h3>How to Get Started<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Send us your bottle dimensions<\/li>\n<li>Choose your preferred style and quantity<\/li>\n<li>Select printing and coating options<\/li>\n<li>Review your free digital mockup<\/li>\n<li>Approve the design and confirm your order<\/li>\n<li>Receive your custom boxes at your doorstep<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Our design and customer support team stays with you throughout the process. If you&#8217;re also searching for eco-friendly alternatives or lightweight packaging options, our <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-paper-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"693\">Cardboard Paper Boxes<\/strong><\/a> are another popular choice among businesses that value cost-effective and recyclable packaging.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Why Shop Cardboard Boxes Is the Right Choice<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom sizes and styles available<\/li>\n<li>Free design services with every order<\/li>\n<li>Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV coatings<\/li>\n<li>Fast turnaround time (4\u20136 business days)<\/li>\n<li>High-quality material and color printing<\/li>\n<li>Eco-friendly and recyclable stock<\/li>\n<li>Bulk order support and wholesale pricing<\/li>\n<li>Free nationwide shipping<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Whether you need <strong>empty cardboard boxes for bottles<\/strong>, <strong>large cardboard boxes for bottles<\/strong>, or small multi-pack units, we\u2019re here to help.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers high-quality Cardboard Boxes For Bottles at wholesale prices, ensuring durable packaging for your bottle products. We offer custom printing options, including gloss, matte, and spot UV, to help your brand stand out. We also offer free design and shipping, as well as fast turnaround times. Order Now.<\/p>\n<div class=\"container\"><\/div>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2474,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[185],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2356","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-packaging-for-specific-items","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Shop Custom Cardboard Boxes For Bottles , Wholesale Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Customizable cardboard boxes in various sizes and styles to protect your bottles during transport or storage. Order Yours Today!\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-boxes-for-bottles\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Shop Custom Cardboard Boxes For Bottles , Wholesale Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:descripti